#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SD0013 expect=skipped domain=CO
#note "R-7 (ruled 2026-08-19): CO is excluded per both twin sheets ('SPECIAL PURPOSE (-CO)'), so a sponsor-invented COSTDTC/COENDTC pair does not fire FDA-SD0013. Out-of-scope primary = skipped."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset CO class="SPECIAL PURPOSE" label="Comments"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col COVAL   type=Char label="Comment"
col COSTDTC type=Char label="Start Date/Time (nonstandard)"
col COENDTC type=Char label="End Date/Time (nonstandard)"
---
S1 | CO | 001 | a note | 2026-02-01 | 2026-01-20
